OL,3,A'I was born in South Africa', says
OL,4,Abeauty queen facing legal bid to deport
OL,5,Aher
OL,6,
OL,7,FBeauty queen Chidimma Adetshina, who is
OL,8,Ffacing deportation from South Africa,
OL,9,Fhas reiterated that she was born in the
OL,10,Fcountry and believes she has been
OL,11,F"treated unfairly and targeted".
OL,13,FSouth African officials want her
OL,14,Fdetained as they pursue her deportation
OL,15,Fafter she was declared a prohibited
OL,16,Fperson in 2024.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
