OL,3,A'I was born in South Africa', says
OL,4,Abeauty queen facing legal bid to deport
OL,5,Aher
OL,6,
OL,7,FAdetshina, 25, whose mother has
OL,8,FMozambican roots and her father is
OL,9,FNigerian, was stripped of her identity
OL,10,Fdocuments after questions around her
OL,11,Fcitizenship were raised when she took
OL,12,Fpart in the 2024 Miss South Africa
OL,13,Fcontest. She then left the country.
OL,15,FShe was arrested in June this year -
OL,16,Fand later released on warning - after
OL,17,Fbeing accused of re-entering South
OL,18,FAfrica unlawfully.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
